      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a great start, the atmosphere is definitely there. To make it feel even more real for the reader, I want to focus on the people in this neighborhood. Can you describe some of the groups or types of people you'd see hanging out on these corners or wandering the streets? I want to capture that sense of who actually controls these blocks and what the \"vibe\" of the local population is to make the danger feel more specific.",
